# PR-31: track the collision-mesh generator script (`blender/script.py`)
# so its output format stays in sync with `src/ecs/physics/MapLoader.cpp`'s
# type-prefix parser.  Ignore blender's binary artefacts (`.blend`, autosave,
# backup files) instead of the whole directory — git's ignore rules don't
# allow re-including files under an excluded directory, so we list the
# binary patterns explicitly.
blender/*.blend
blender/*.blend1
blender/*.blend2
blender/*.blend3
blender/*.blend4
blender/*.blend5
blender/*.blend6
blender/*.blend7
blender/*.blend8
blender/*.blend9
blender/*.blend@
blender/*.blend~

